1
00:00:14,664 --> 00:00:20,132
Il est tard, Marinette. Tu te brosses les dents ?
It’s late, Marinette. Are you brushing your teeth?

2
00:00:20,232 --> 00:00:24,020
Oui, je me brosse les dents maintenant.
Yes, I’m brushing my teeth now.

3
00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:27,524
Et après, tu te couches ?
And after that, are you going to bed?

4
00:00:27,624 --> 00:00:31,100
Oui, mais je veux lire un peu.
Yes, but I want to read a little.

5
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:36,764
D'accord. Tu peux lire un livre, puis dormir.
All right. You can read a book, then sleep.

6
00:00:36,864 --> 00:00:41,036
Tu viens me dire bonsoir, s'il te plaît ?
Will you come say good night to me, please?

7
00:00:41,136 --> 00:00:45,860
Bien sûr. Je viens dans la chambre.
Of course. I’m coming into the bedroom.

8
00:00:45,960 --> 00:00:50,396
Merci. Tu éteins la lampe ?
Thanks. Will you turn off the lamp?

9
00:00:50,496 --> 00:00:55,316
Oui. Dors bien, Marinette.
Yes. Sleep well, Marinette.
